OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid after death of
OL,4,Aboxing champion
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to former
OL,7,FBritish and Commonwealth boxing
OL,8,Fchampion Tony Laing, who died last
OL,9,Fmonth at the age of 68.
OL,11,FBorn in Jamaica on 22 September 1957,
OL,12,Fhe was raised in Nottingham and enjoyed
OL,13,Fa successful professional career in the
OL,14,F1980s, winning the British and
OL,15,FCommonwealth light-welterweight titles.
OL,17,FHe stayed in Nottingham after retiring
OL,18,Fand coached young boxers across the
OL,19,Fcity.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
