OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid after death of
OL,4,Aboxing champion
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer world champion Jawaid Khaliq,
OL,7,Fwho runs JK Boxing Academy in St Ann's,
OL,8,Fsaid Laing was "a legend" and "one of
OL,9,Fthe greats" for Nottingham boxers.
